%% request: zero trust access to internal apps
%% fixed from tool errors
flowchart TD
    User([👩‍💻 Employee laptop]) --> Req[Request app.internal.co]
    Req --> IdP{{🪪 Identity provider SSO}}
    IdP --> MFA{MFA passed?}
    MFA -- no --> Deny([🚫 Denied and logged])
    MFA -- yes --> Device{Device posture OK? disk, OS, EDR}
    Device -- no --> Deny
    Device -- yes --> Policy{Role, geo/IP and session risk pass?}
    Policy -- no --> Deny
    Policy -- yes --> PEP[Access proxy PEP]
    Policy -. step-up .-> IdP
    PEP -->|per-request mTLS| App[(Internal app)]
    PEP --> Audit[(Audit log)]
    Audit --> SIEM{{SIEM alerts}}
    SIEM -->|anomaly| Revoke[Revoke session]
    Revoke --> IdP

    classDef allow fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2e7d32
    classDef deny fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#c62828
    class App allow
    class Deny deny
